{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a world where each step counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities that transform how you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in an emotional journey about finding your place</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steps is a narrative puzzle-adventure game set in a block-world where the riddles and challenges lie in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is full of hidden areas and treasures to discover. Learn abilities that reveal new paths through the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a block-being in search of finding its purpose, you will encounter other blocks on their journey, with the opportunity to influence their story and your own.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947860?t=1756808309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947860/1d9493016946fb265c9f5d6919415917e4d282d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756808309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947860/214bb5e07688cd6e0f8206efcf2f6124beeb305b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756808309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947860/214bb5e07688cd6e0f8206efcf2f6124beeb305b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756808309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a world where each step counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities that transform how you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in an emotional journey abou